|---|------|-------|---------|---------|
| 1 | Engine + Midnight Archive + wire 2 routes (first visible slice) | Codex sol Â· high, worktree | workspace-write | â€” |
| 2 | Illuminated Keep theme package against task-1 manifest contract | Codex terra Â· medium | workspace-write | 1 + slice approval |
| 3 | Playwright coverage: themes Ã— viewports Ã— living-mask Ã— URL params | Codex terra Â· medium | workspace-write | 1 + slice approval |
| 4 | Verification & integration: diffs, npm run check, e2e, AA, screenshots | Claude orchestrator | â€” | 1â€“3 |

First-visible-slice checkpoint: after task 1, stop and let the owner choose review evidence before 2â€“3.

## Verification

Directional intent alignment against the round-4 board (hierarchy, states, theme language â€” not pixels);
unit tests on layout function; Playwright screenshots both themes/viewports; privacy assertion (client
viewer receives only masked living data); `npm run check` green.

## Known risks

Long names in shield clip-path (fallback: plaque shape past threshold); Midnight print/light export
variant deferred; story links render only when `story.personIds` matches; no pre-existing canvas tests.
